        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You corrode a useful piece of tech into obsolete junk. The target takes 1d8 acid damage, with a basic Reflex save if the target is a creature or by a creature holding or wielding the target. The target becomes @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Glitching]{Glitching 2} on a failure (or if unattended). If this damage reduces the target to 0 Hit Points, it becomes junk, and as long as it's unattended, any space it occupies becomes difficult terrain.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> Increase the damage by 1d8 and the glitching condition by 1.</p>"
